WEBVTT

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:06.480
This is the site of the PPSE Stadium,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.310
where the World Championship used to be held.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.320
Now, there's only a monument here...

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:17.070
...on which the names of world
champion fighters are engraved.

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:20.280
The stadium was torn down...

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:25.460
...because a Plavsky particle
crystal went out of control.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:30.170
But thanks to some great fighters,

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:32.630
they succeeded in
destroying the crystal.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.630
The worst case scenario was avoided.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.220
It's been seven years since that incident.

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.390
Thanks to those fighters,
we can keep playing Gunpla Battle.

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:49.690
And the fighting will
take place again this year.

00:00:50.310 --> 00:00:51.440
The stage is...

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:54.530
...the new holy site of Gunpla Battle.

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:56.440
And its name is...
And its name is...

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.990
...Yajima Stadium!
...Yajima Stadium!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:25.060
<i>Our wings couldn't wait for the wind, so we set out</i>

00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:30.560
<i>We were bathed in the light of the frozen sun</i>

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:33.320
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh there are no limits</i>

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:36.070
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh just let it go</i>

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:41.620
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh loneliness won't break us</i>

00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:46.160
<i>At the end of the dream we'll never give up,</i>

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.790
<i>Will there be a future that can never end?</i>

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:54.380
<i>Believe in what only you can do</i>

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.090
<i>If I could seize one thing,</i>

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:59.800
<i>I'd choose it without hesitation</i>

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:05.100
<i>Follow your instincts, just hold on to our bond</i>

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:11.650
<i>Up to the endless sky, now! Fly away</i>

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:33.000
<i>GUNDAM BUILD FIGHTERS TRY</i>

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:45.850
So this is the venue
for the National Tournament.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:48.640
Yajima Stadium.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:53.940
This venue, built specially for
Gunpla Battle, will be your stage.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.650
We're finally here.

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:57.230
Yes.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:01.440
To come here, and battle here...

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.110
I've always dreamed of it.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:09.700
You.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:13.710
Thank you for keeping
the promise we made as kids.

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.830
No need to thank me, I just...

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:18.500
Thanks.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:23.630
Why are you talking
like it's over?

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.340
The battle hasn't even started yet!

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:28.640
You're right.

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:30.680
Let's get to our lodgings.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.680
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.570
So many people!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:50.490
There are 49 teams representing every
prefecture throughout all of Japan.

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:54.500
Including the staff,
that's more than 300 people.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:03:58.540
They're the ones we met at camp.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.420
Kagoshima's Gabai Institute...

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.260
And don't forget about me!

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.010
Y-You're...

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.430
Um...

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:12.560
Who was he?

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:13.640
It's Karima!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.690
I'm Kei Karima from Honmoku Academy,
representing Kanagawa!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.240
The Gunpla Academy.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.620
They've won the nationals
six times in a row.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:36.080
They're the top-seeded
defending champions this year, too.

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:38.830
That's their coach, Allan Adams.

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:42.250
He used to be in charge of
PPSE's Gunpla development.

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.840
And Wilfrid Kijima.

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:48.840
A regular member since middle school,
he's definitely the ace of the team.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.760
Saga Adou.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.520
Also known as "Dead End Saga."

00:04:53.810 --> 00:04:57.850
Rumor has it that
he's broken over 1,000 Gunpla.

00:04:57.850 --> 00:05:01.270
Where's Akira Suga?
He was a regular member last year.

00:05:01.770 --> 00:05:03.980
I heard that he transferred.

00:05:03.980 --> 00:05:06.320
ls that good news?

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:07.280
Who knows?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.240
Wilfrid Kijima!

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.540
Sekai... Kamiki.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.870
Don't lose until we fight each other.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.130
Who is that?

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.300
He was being arrogant
with the Gunpla Academy!

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:31.760
Sekai...

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.850
He's making enemies again.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:39.520
Th-That gushy

00:05:39.520 --> 00:05:40.690
What is it?

00:05:40.690 --> 00:05:42.270
Hey, Yuu!

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:47.320
That was close.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:51.780
I made a nuisance of myself, begged
on my knees, and finally made the team.

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.580
I suffered a lot to get here.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.000
My reunion with my rival Yuuma
must be more dramatic!

00:05:57.370 --> 00:06:00.830
"You're Minato Sakai of
the Gunpla Shingyo School!"

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.710
"It's been a while, Yuuma Kousaka."

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:06.340
"Now face my ultimate Gunpla!"

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.670
Yeah, just like when
Char and Sayla met again!

00:06:18.680 --> 00:06:22.730
If you don't push the floor button,
the elevator won't move.

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:28.480
K-K-Kousaka...

00:06:28.570 --> 00:06:29.740
What an incidence.

00:06:29.820 --> 00:06:31.820
You mean, "what a coincidence."

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.240
Thanks for the lecture. Bye.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:38.830
Are you entering the nationals?

00:06:39.870 --> 00:06:44.830
I assume that's because your Gunpla was
defeated in the West Tokyo qualifiers, right?

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:45.670
Am I wrong?

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:49.260
Yeah, you're completely right!

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:51.420
Remember this, Yuuma!

00:06:51.420 --> 00:06:55.510
With the ultimate Gunpla I built,
I'll take you all down-

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:00.890
This is terrible!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.440
That was such an uncool reunion!

00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.520
I won't accept it!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:12.450
Episode 15
Reborn Try Fighters!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.990
Minato Sakai of the
Gunpla Shingyo School?

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:18.490
Oh, I battled him at G-Muse.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:21.410
ls he that weird guy who
speaks with an Osaka accent?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.290
Yes.

00:07:22.290 --> 00:07:26.330
Looks like he's entering
the National Tournament...

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.880
...as a member of Osaka's
representative team.

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.380
Right?

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.800
Yes, that's right.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:36.220
Then that makes us rivals.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.180
Don't be too hard on us, Sakai.

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:39.640
That's my Fumina!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.480
I deeply appreciate your kind words.

00:07:42.890 --> 00:07:45.850
But if you fight against my team,

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:47.310
I can't go easy on you.

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:50.400
Say, what kind of Gunpla will you
be using in the tournament?

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:53.860
As the work of the Shingyo School,
it must be a strong one, right?

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.530
Well, I suppose you could say that.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:57.990
You want to listen and be amazed?

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:58.910
Yes, yes.

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:03.660
I built it for this tournament
using all my plamo techniques.

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.790
It's a very special machine!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.460
What's the base Gunpla?

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:09.340
The ZZ.

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.510
Hey, why am I telling
secrets to the enemy?!

00:08:12.590 --> 00:08:14.590
So you're not quite that stupid.

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:18.010
Don't make fun of me.

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:23.140
Anyway, my Gunpla is ten billion times
stronger than your Lightning.

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:24.350
Ten billion times?

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:25.850
What a childish line.

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:31.440
You know, you shouldn't assume that
Yuuma's Gunpla is the same as before.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.150
What?!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:35.820
It's been reborn for
the National Tournament.

00:08:35.900 --> 00:08:37.910
Its name is Lightning Gundam Full-

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.280
Don't tell our secrets
to an opponent!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:42.790
What are you saying...?!

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:44.040
Oh, no.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.870
I forgot we had an idiot
on our team, too.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:49.540
Yuuma Kousaka.

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:54.300
At the Artistic Gunpla Contest
held this last spring,

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.260
he's the builder who
won the Grand Prix.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:08:58.800
As for the noisy guy
with the Osaka accent,

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:01.760
he's Minato Sakai of
the Gunpla Shingyo School.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:05.430
So the master builders from the
east and the west are both entering.

00:09:05.430 --> 00:09:06.810
No big deal.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:09.650
Even if you can build
the most beautiful Gunpla,

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:12.570
it's not so easy to win
the National Tournament.

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.900
Our objective is...

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.780
...to defeat the Gunpla Academy.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.280
Adou, how's your right wrist?

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.660
It's completely healed.

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:26.330
I have a doctor's note saying as much.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.500
Good.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:29.670
And what about the new machine?

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.710
She started building it early,
so that it would be finished in time.

00:09:33.800 --> 00:09:35.840
Don't worry, Uncle.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.010
I told you, call me "Coach" here.

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:39.260
Oops, you did.

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:41.470
Chief Allan!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.260
Call me "Coach," Suzuki.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:44.430
S-Sorry.

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:46.270
What is it?

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:48.940
I received the member list
for the participating teams,

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.940
and there's a name here
that caught my attention.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.520
Caught your attention?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.440
Yes.

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:59.110
The Miyagi Prefecture team has
Junya lnose listed as one of its members.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.030
lnose?!

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:02.620
Junya Inose?!

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:04.620
Brother, who is he?

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:07.160
Oh, that's right.
You don't know him.

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.420
We've won five times in a row
at the National Tournament,

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:13.460
but he's the only one
we couldn't defeat in battle.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.420
He entered the nationals
the year before last,

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.130
and ended up in a tie with Sleggar.

00:10:20.590 --> 00:10:23.300
If I'd been there, I would've crushed him.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.510
Junya lnose didn't enter last year.

00:10:26.510 --> 00:10:29.310
I didn't expect that
he'd be on the Miyagi team.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.140
ls he strong?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.400
Yeah, he's strong.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.150
He uses kenpo.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:47.740
I ate a lot.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:50.750
There's food service,
plus bathrooms and beds.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.670
When I'm on a training trip,
I normally sleep outside,

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:56.250
so this place feels like heaven!

00:10:56.670 --> 00:10:59.420
That's how he's been
spending his life until now?

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:00.470
Yuuma.

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:03.680
Your Gunpla's already completed.
What are you doing now?

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:05.220
Building spare parts.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.890
The battle rules for the
National Tournament...

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:10.640
...set the model damage level to A.

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:14.480
They'll take a lot more damage
than in the regional qualifiers.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:17.980
Sekai, during the battle,
look after your Gunpla and...

00:11:23.860 --> 00:11:26.240
He's got some nerve.

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.500
<i>Tomorrow's the opening ceremony,</i>

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.250
<i>and the first match after
the brackets are announced.</i>

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:37.500
<i>We'll win for sure...</i>

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.340
<i>...with my new Winning.</i>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.510
<i>All of us together!</i>

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.440
It's not nerve, he's just crude.

00:11:56.520 --> 00:12:00.440
I can't believe that idiot
is related to Miss Mirai!

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:10.950
Here, here!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.450
Sorry.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.830
Let's go, quick.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.750
The opening ceremony is starting!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:16.620
Right.

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:17.710
Hurry up, guys!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.210
R-Right!

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.220
Sekai and the others...?

00:12:24.300 --> 00:12:26.800
Why are they still here?

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.890
You wouldn't wake up!

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.510
Your snoring was too loud!

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:31.970
Just hurry UP!

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:38.480
We've now come to
the end of the ceremony.

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:40.650
<i>Next up,</i>

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:43.530
<i>we'll announce the brackets
for the tournament.</i>

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.780
We barely made it.

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:47.360
Our presenter is the woman

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.490
Our presenter is the woman
It's Yuuma's fault!

00:12:48.490 --> 00:12:49.620
<i>serving as the image character for this tournament,
It's your fault!</i>

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:50.450
<i>serving as the image character for this tournament,
No yours!</i>

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.330
<i>serving as the image character for this tournament,</i>

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:52.790
<i>Miss Mirai Kamiki!</i>

00:13:15.810 --> 00:13:17.140
B-Big sis?!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:18.520
Why is she here?

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:19.600
She's beautiful!

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:24.280
I was selected as the
championship's image character.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.940
My name is Mirai Kamiki.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:31.160
As you all strive toward the championship,
please remember to fight fair and square.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.870
I'll be cheering for you!

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:44.550
Lo...

00:13:44.880 --> 00:13:45.840
Lo...

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.050
Lovely!
Lovely!

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:52.850
Miss Mirai...

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.560
You okay, Yuuma?

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:57.060
You have a lot more rivals now.

00:13:57.930 --> 00:13:59.390
Not good!

00:14:01.060 --> 00:14:07.070
<i>Now, in the 13th Gunpla Battle
Japanese Under-19 Championship,</i>

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.370
I'll announce the brackets
for the tournament.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.580
Ready, set...

00:14:15.240 --> 00:14:16.620
Go!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.540
Go!
Go!

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:30.760
Our turn is...

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:32.180
No way!

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:32.680
Seiho Academy

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.550
Seiho Academy

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:34.890
Seiho Academy

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.850
Seiho Academy

00:14:36.850 --> 00:14:36.930
Seiho Academy

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.890
Hurry and get ready, you two!

00:14:38.970 --> 00:14:40.350
O-Okay!
O-Okay!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.100
I see. So it all begins...

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:44.770
...with the Try Fighters.

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:48.280
That burning boy will appear, huh?

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.530
So, who's their opponent?

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:52.360
This is bad.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.950
Okhotsk Academy,
representing South Hokkaido.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.370
They were in the best eight last year.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:03.120
My condolences, Yuuma.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.920
From the start, they face strong foes.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:12.220
But if they win this,
they can ride on the wave.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.970
Sekai, Miss Hoshino, Kousaka.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.180
You can do it.

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.770
Are you both prepped
and ready for this?

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:27.730
You bet!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:28.480
I'm ready.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:34.200
Then, let's show our rivals
the power of our new Gunpla!

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:35.110
Yeah!
Yeah!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.990
Team Try Fighters!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.620
Go...
Go...

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:40.410
"fight!
"fight!

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:45.460
<i>Okhotsk Academy Seiho Academy
We now begin match one.</i>

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:49.250
<i>Representing West Tokyo,
Seiho Academy Middle School,</i>

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.510
<i>team Try Fighters versus...</i>

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.840
<i>...representing South Hokkaido,
Okhotsk Academy,</i>

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.640
<i>team Amorphous.</i>

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:01.560
<i>Gunpla Battle, combat mode, startup.</i>

00:16:02.270 --> 00:16:04.850
<i>Model damage level, set to A.</i>

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.650
Please set your GP Base.

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:11.480
<i>Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.740
<i>Field 1, Space.</i>

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.370
Please set your Gunpla.

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:24.750
Miss Fumina's new Winning.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.290
As I thought, she upgraded it.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.880
The backpack...

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:36.470
It's completely new.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:51.360
So that's Sekai's...

00:16:51.360 --> 00:16:53.400
My rival's Gunpla.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:57.400
<i>Battle start.</i>

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:03.490
Fumina Hoshino, Star Winning Gundam.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:07.410
Yuuma Kousaka,
Lightning Gundam Full Burnern.

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.880
Sekai Kamiki, Try Burning Gundam.

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:13.340
Team Try Fighters,

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:14.260
let's go!

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:15.340
Here I come.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:17.260
Here goes!

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.350
Sekai, save your particle energy
until we reach the battle zone.

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:27.980
Get on, Sekai.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.690
Thanks, Yuuma.

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:32.820
Let's go, Yuu!

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:33.770
<i>Roger that.</i>

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.280
I see the opponents!

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.580
They're in formation.

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:45.290
Kyrios. Raider.

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:46.660
Gabthley.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:49.290
They're all transformable.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:51.790
Pattern six. Let's split the formation.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.460
Roger that.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:04.310
Go!

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.520
He came on his own?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:17.230
It won't stop!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.360
Let's show them.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:23.370
<i>Try Burning!</i>

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:38.840
Show them our new power!

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:48.850
Yoshiya!

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.520
That's what he used at camp.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.440
<i>Darn you!</i>

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.360
<i>Funnels!</i>

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:01.860
<i>Take this!</i>

00:19:07.700 --> 00:19:09.200
They split the beams?!

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.920
This is the power...

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:23.430
...of the reborn Winning!

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.260
How dare you!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:30.220
Trans-Am!

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:37.270
The machine turned red?!

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.230
It sure is fast.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:40.570
Leave it to me!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:48.660
Without transforming, you won't
catch my Kyrios in Trans-Am.

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:50.700
Wh-What?!

00:19:58.790 --> 00:20:01.510
<i>My dry heart...</i>

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:01.510
How did it catch up?

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.300
<i>...cries out, and I awaken</i>

00:20:01.510 --> 00:20:05.300
When I'm in Trans-Am,
my particle emission is tripled!

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.050
<i>We were searching for it</i>

00:20:07.050 --> 00:20:09.600
<i>Our one and only strength</i>

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:12.470
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh We were hurting</i>

00:20:12.470 --> 00:20:15.190
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh But we accepted the challenge</i>

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.390
Its basic performance is...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:20.980
<i>Oh Oh Oh Oh Oh We're learning from our tears</i>

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.810
...superior to mine in Trans-Am!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:25.320
<i>With these lives that we cannot change,</i>

00:20:25.320 --> 00:20:27.910
<i>we'll change the future, right?</i>

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:29.330
<i>Don't shed any more tears</i>

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:33.370
<i>Take hold of your unwavering desire</i>

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:34.830
Darn it. Move, move!

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:36.170
<i>If you know what it's like to have regrets,</i>

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.830
<i>Then you can still see your dreams</i>

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.340
<i>Don't get tied up</i>

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:41.130
Jigen Haoh School!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:44.470
<i>Common sense is just an illusion</i>

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:47.220
<i>Don't shy away from pain</i>

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:50.140
(Shooting Star Spiral Fist)
Ryusei Rasen-Ken!

00:20:47.220 --> 00:20:50.140
<i>Fly away</i>

00:21:26.550 --> 00:21:27.760
<i>Battle ended.</i>

00:21:35.720 --> 00:21:38.190
<i>The winner of the first match is...</i>

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:41.560
<i>...Seiho Academy Middle School,
representing West Tokyo,</i>

00:21:41.560 --> 00:21:43.480
<i>team Try Fighters!</i>

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:49.910
The Jigen Haoh School...

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:56.080
Sekai Kamiki.

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:06.000
<i>There's a tomorrow I want to touch</i>

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:09.380
<i>I want to prove it for myself</i>

00:22:09.380 --> 00:22:14.180
<i>Love, hate, which is it?</i>

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:18.020
<i>Perhaps the challenge is in the journey</i>

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:21.100
<i>Wandering the unknown path...</i>

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:27.860
<i>...toward abundant happiness</i>

00:22:29.610 --> 00:22:32.610
<i>I was afraid to run</i>

00:22:32.610 --> 00:22:35.990
<i>But now that I've started, I can't stop</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.790
<i>I must've been waiting for the go sign</i>

00:22:38.790 --> 00:22:42.620
<i>With this passion in my impatient heart,</i>

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:47.300
<i>I want to search for something</i>

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:52.050
<i>Let's meet over and over again (with you)</i>

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>On this journey, can you show me...</i>

00:22:54.340 --> 00:22:59.390
<i>...a different truth? (let me see)</i>

00:22:59.390 --> 00:23:06.320
<i>The power to find new things (with me)</i>

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.780
<i>Never forget it</i>

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:12.200
<i>Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:12.740
<i>(Today)
Bring the real you to meet the real me</i>

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:14.360
<i>(Today)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:14.360 --> 00:23:15.240
<i>(I'll be there...)
As we travel, you smile at me</i>

00:23:15.240 --> 00:23:18.240
<i>(I'll be there...)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:18.240 --> 00:23:20.620
<i>(Alive!)
I love it, I love it, this journey without a compass</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:21.580
<i>(Alive!)</i>

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:27.500
Team Try Fighters!

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.380
<i>We now begin match four.</i>

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:34.010
Keep searching for enemies.

00:23:34.470 --> 00:23:35.510
<i>Something from above!</i>

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:36.470
What?!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:44.690
This is the Gunpla...

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:47.270
...that I poured my heart and soul into!

00:23:53.700 --> 00:23:57.320
It's the essence of
the Gunpla Shingyo School!

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.330
Minato Sakai's Gunpla...

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:05.960
...and Shia Kijima's Gunpla
will finally be unveiled.

00:24:06.210 --> 00:24:07.040
Next episode, "Magnificent Shia".

00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:07.960
Magnificent Shia
Next episode, "Magnificent Shia".

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:09.540
Magnificent Shia
Simply overwhelming!

00:24:09.540 --> 00:24:10.050
Magnificent Shia
